--     * Slot: file_id Description: When known, describes the image file that is executed when <code>type_id</code> is <code>COM Handler</code> or <code>Execute</code>. Note that this attribute is intended to supplement the <code>com_class_uid</code> or <code>cmd_line</code> attributes, and is not an alternative to them.
