--     * Slot: keyboard_subtype Description: The keyboard numeric code.
--     * Slot: keyboard_type Description: The keyboard type (e.g., xt, ico).
-- # Class: OcsfKillChainPhase Description: The Kill Chain Phase object represents a single phase of a cyber attack, including the initial reconnaissance and planning stages up to the final objective of the attacker. It provides a detailed description of each phase and its associated activities within the broader context of a cyber attack.
--     * Slot: id
--     * Slot: phase Description: The cyber kill chain phase.
--     * Slot: phase_id Description: The cyber kill chain phase identifier.
--     * Slot: OcsfFindingInfo_id Description: Autocreated FK slot
--     * Slot: OcsfOsint_id Description: Autocreated FK slot
--     * Slot: OcsfRelatedEvent_id Description: Autocreated FK slot
