--     * Slot: severity Description: The severity of the malware, normalized to the captions of the <code>severity_id</code> values. In the case of 'Other', they are defined by the event source.
--     * Slot: severity_id Description: The normalized identifier of the malware severity.
--     * Slot: name Description: The malware name, as reported by the detection engine.
--     * Slot: uid Description: A unique identifier for the specific malware instance, as assigned by the detection engine (e.g., virus signature ID or IPS rule ID).
--     * Slot: uid_numeric Description: The <code>uid</code> attribute in numeric form where applicable.<br><strong>Note:</strong> Producers may populate <code>uid_numeric</code> only in addition to <code>uid</code> and not as an alternative to it.
