--     * Slot: desc Description: A human-readable description of the node's purpose or meaning in the graph.
--     * Slot: name Description: A human-readable name or label for the node. Should be descriptive and unique within the graph context.
--     * Slot: type Description: Categorizes the node into a specific class or type. Useful for grouping and filtering nodes.
--     * Slot: uid Description: A unique string or numeric identifier that distinguishes this node from all others in the graph. Must be unique across all nodes.
--     * Slot: OcsfGraph_id Description: Autocreated FK slot
