--     * Slot: name Description: The full name of the observable attribute. The <code>name</code> is a pointer/reference to an attribute within the OCSF event data. For example: <code>file.name</code>. Array attributes may be represented in one of three ways. For example: <code>resources.uid</code>, <code>resources[].uid</code>, <code>resources[0].uid</code>.
