-- # Class: OcsfObservation Description: A record of an observed value or event that captures the timing and frequency of its occurrence. Used to track when values/events were first detected, last detected, and their total occurrence count.
--     * Slot: id
--     * Slot: count Description: Integer representing the total number of times this specific value/event was observed across all occurrences. Helps establish prevalence and patterns.
