--     * Slot: num_processes Description: The number of processes scanned.
--     * Slot: num_registry_items Description: The number of registry items scanned.
--     * Slot: num_resolutions Description: The number of items that were resolved.
--     * Slot: num_skipped_items Description: The number of skipped items.
--     * Slot: num_trusted_items Description: The number of trusted items.
--     * Slot: schedule_uid Description: The unique identifier of the schedule associated with a scan job.
