--     * Slot: cloud_id Description: Describes details about the Cloud environment where the event or finding was created.
--     * Slot: actor_id Description: Describes details about the actor implicated in the data security finding. Either an actor that owns a particular digital file or information store, or an actor which accessed classified or sensitive data.
--     * Slot: device_id Description: Describes the device where classified or sensitive data is stored in, or was accessed from.
--     * Slot: firewall_rule_id Description: The firewall rule that pertains to the control that triggered the event, if applicable.
