--     * Slot: status_id Description: The normalized incident lifecycle status identifier. This tracks the incident management workflow from initial triage through resolution. Producers should set this to reflect the current state in their incident management system.
--     * Slot: time Description: The incident creation time - when the incident was first opened, not when the underlying activity occurred. For the time range of contributing events, use <code>start_time</code> and <code>end_time</code>.
