--     * Slot: confidence_score Description: The confidence score assigned to the incident by the system or analyst, expressed on a source-specific numeric scale. This score provides finer-grained confidence information than the categorical <code>confidence_id</code> value. When <code>confidence_id</code> is <code>99</code> (Other), the <code>confidence</code> attribute should reflect the same assessment if both are populated.
