--     * Slot: OcsfVulnerability_id Description: Autocreated FK slot
--     * Slot: references Description: A list of reference URLs with additional information about the vulnerability.
-- # Class: OcsfVulnerability_related_vulnerabilities
--     * Slot: OcsfVulnerability_id Description: Autocreated FK slot
--     * Slot: related_vulnerabilities Description: List of vulnerability IDs (e.g. CVE ID) that are related to this vulnerability.
-- # Class: OcsfWebResource_labels
--     * Slot: OcsfWebResource_id Description: Autocreated FK slot
--     * Slot: labels Description: The list of labels associated to the resource.
-- # Class: OcsfWhois_name_servers
--     * Slot: OcsfWhois_id Description: Autocreated FK slot
--     * Slot: name_servers Description: A collection of name servers related to a domain registration or other record.
-- # Class: OcsfWhois_subdomains
--     * Slot: OcsfWhois_id Description: Autocreated FK slot
--     * Slot: subdomains Description: An array of subdomain strings. Can be used to collect several subdomains such as those from Domain Generation Algorithms (DGAs).
-- # Class: OcsfWinRegValue_reg_string_list_data
--     * Slot: OcsfWinRegValue_id Description: Autocreated FK slot
--     * Slot: reg_string_list_data Description: The data of the registry value when <code>type_id</code> is <code>REG_MULTI_SZ</code>.
-- # Class: OcsfWinResource_labels
--     * Slot: OcsfWinResource_id Description: Autocreated FK slot
--     * Slot: labels Description: The list of labels associated to the resource.
-- # Class: OcsfWinService_service_dependencies
--     * Slot: OcsfWinService_id Description: Autocreated FK slot
--     * Slot: service_dependencies Description: The names of other services upon which this service has a dependency.
-- # Class: OcsfWinService_labels
--     * Slot: OcsfWinService_id Description: Autocreated FK slot
--     * Slot: labels Description: The list of labels associated with the service.
-- # Class: OcsfFileHosting_access_list
--     * Slot: OcsfFileHosting_id Description: Autocreated FK slot
--     * Slot: access_list Description: The list of requested access rights.
-- # Class: OcsfSecurityFinding_data_sources
--     * Slot: OcsfSecurityFinding_id Description: Autocreated FK slot
--     * Slot: data_sources Description: A list of data sources utilized in generation of the finding.
-- # Class: OcsfSecurityFinding_nist
--     * Slot: OcsfSecurityFinding_id Description: Autocreated FK slot
--     * Slot: nist Description: The NIST Cybersecurity Framework recommendations for managing the cybersecurity risk.
-- # Class: OcsfAuthorizeSession_privileges
--     * Slot: OcsfAuthorizeSession_id Description: Autocreated FK slot
--     * Slot: privileges Description: The list of sensitive privileges, assigned to the new user session.
-- # Class: OcsfEntityManagement_access_list
--     * Slot: OcsfEntityManagement_id Description: Autocreated FK slot
--     * Slot: access_list Description: The list of requested access rights.
-- # Class: OcsfGroupManagement_privileges
--     * Slot: OcsfGroupManagement_id Description: Autocreated FK slot
--     * Slot: privileges Description: A list of privileges assigned to the group.
-- # Class: OcsfRoleManagement_privileges
--     * Slot: OcsfRoleManagement_id Description: Autocreated FK slot
--     * Slot: privileges Description: A list of privileges assigned to or removed from <code>iam_role</code>.
-- # Class: OcsfUserAccess_privileges
--     * Slot: OcsfUserAccess_id Description: Autocreated FK slot
--     * Slot: privileges Description: List of privileges assigned to a user.
-- # Class: OcsfUserManagement_privileges
--     * Slot: OcsfUserManagement_id Description: Autocreated FK slot
--     * Slot: privileges Description: Set of privileges assigned to a user.
-- # Class: OcsfDnsActivity_flag_ids
--     * Slot: OcsfDnsActivity_id Description: Autocreated FK slot
--     * Slot: flag_ids Description: The list of DNS message header flag IDs. For Query events, populated from the query header (RD, CD). For Response and Traffic events, populated from the response header, which is the complete and authoritative source as it echoes all client-set flags and adds server-set flags.
-- # Class: OcsfDnsActivity_flags
--     * Slot: OcsfDnsActivity_id Description: Autocreated FK slot
--     * Slot: flags Description: The list of DNS message header flags, normalized to the captions of the <code>flag_ids</code> values.
-- # Class: OcsfEmailActivity_to
--     * Slot: OcsfEmailActivity_id Description: Autocreated FK slot
--     * Slot: to Description: The recipient address from the transmission envelope. This may differ from the 'To' header and represents where the message was actually delivered.
-- # Class: OcsfFtpActivity_codes
--     * Slot: OcsfFtpActivity_id Description: Autocreated FK slot
--     * Slot: codes Description: The list of return codes to the FTP command.
-- # Class: OcsfFtpActivity_command_responses
--     * Slot: OcsfFtpActivity_id Description: Autocreated FK slot
--     * Slot: command_responses Description: The list of responses to the FTP command.
-- # Class: OcsfRdpActivity_capabilities
--     * Slot: OcsfRdpActivity_id Description: Autocreated FK slot
--     * Slot: capabilities Description: A list of RDP capabilities.
-- # Class: OcsfRdpActivity_certificate_chain
--     * Slot: OcsfRdpActivity_id Description: Autocreated FK slot
--     * Slot: certificate_chain Description: The list of observed certificates in an RDP TLS connection.
-- # Class: OcsfSmbActivity_client_dialects
--     * Slot: OcsfSmbActivity_id Description: Autocreated FK slot
--     * Slot: client_dialects Description: The list of SMB dialects that the client speaks.

